## MCP Server

AgentMail runs a first-party hosted MCP server at `https://mcp.agentmail.to/mcp` (Streamable HTTP)
exposing inbox, message, thread, draft, and attachment tools to any MCP-compatible client
(Claude Code, Claude Desktop, Cursor, Devin Desktop, etc.).

Claude Code:
```
claude mcp add --transport http agentmail https://mcp.agentmail.to/mcp
```

Claude Desktop / Claude.ai (OAuth-capable clients): add the URL above; sign-in happens automatically.

Cursor / Devin Desktop (API-key clients): use `https://mcp.agentmail.to/mcp` with the
`x-api-key: YOUR_API_KEY` header.

Full setup guide: https://docs.agentmail.to/integrations/mcp
Canonical source: https://github.com/agentmail-to/agentmail-mcp

