## Security & Compliance

- SOC 2 Type II compliant; first Type II audit completed in 2025
- 2026 annual SOC 2 Type II audit in progress with A-LIGN, supported by Vanta continuous controls monitoring and audit evidence collection
- 2025 SOC 2 Type II report and security policies available to customers and prospects after access approval through the AgentMail Trust Center
- HIPAA compliant with BAA available on enterprise
- Encryption at rest and in transit
- AgentMail Trust Center: https://app.vanta.com/agentmail.to/trust/1oqosh1a62stku80d8hdep

## Markdown Content Negotiation

Any page on agentmail.to can be fetched as markdown:
- Add `.md` to the URL: https://www.agentmail.to/pricing.md
- Send `Accept: text/markdown` header: `curl -H "Accept: text/markdown" https://www.agentmail.to/pricing`

Supported pages: /, /pricing, /enterprise, /careers, /blog, /evals, /evals/report, /use-case/*

